(This implementation report describes delivery of a graded activity programme for people with) Tj
T*
(chronic low back pain across routine services. Staff training, referral pathways, fidelity,) Tj
T*
(reach, and participant engagement were monitored alongside pain-related function. Adoption) Tj
T*
(was feasible, although local staffing and infrastructure shaped delivery. Differences in) Tj
T*
(adherence were more pronounced among participants recruited through community services. This) Tj
T*
